{"reviews":[{"id":"B0B86TKMP8-0","r":1.0,"t":"Very nice and pretty but\u2026","x":"So i got the viori shampoo and conditioner bars and so i got this holder I followed the YouTube instructions and still it molded i wish i had taken a picture but i was so upset and just threw it away for $10 it is not worth the effort you put in trying to protect it from mold\u2026 i would not recommend this product sorry","h":14,"v":1,"d":"Sep 2021"},{"id":"B0B86TKMP8-1","r":4.0,"t":"Nice idea, but falls short","x":"I really like this storage option, but it has a downfall. It only holds one bar. I wish it came with 2 bottom sections so your conditioner bar could be stored as well. At least an option for this would be nice. I read a review that said it fits 2 bars, that is absolutely NOT true if you use Viori shampoo and conditioner bars. They both will not fit in the bamboo holder.","h":12,"v":1,"d":"Sep 2022"},{"id":"B0B86TKMP8-2","r":5.0,"t":"Works really well!","x":"The holder needs to be cured with cooking oil. Coat with cooking oil/olive oil bake in oven for about 30 minutes. Keep a close eye on it while in the oven. This prevents mold you can get more detailed directions on viori's website.","h":9,"v":1,"d":"Nov 2021"},{"id":"B0B86TKMP8-3","r":5.0,"t":"This bamboo holder is a must for VIORI","x":"Love VIORI shampoo and conditioner and this bamboo holder is a must to keep the bars dry and drained.  You must coat this in oil and let dry before using so that it does not get moldy.  Must do top bottoms and inside out to keep it in good shape.  wish they made one for traveling too.","h":8,"v":1,"d":"Dec 2021"},{"id":"B0B86TKMP8-4","r":1.0,"t":"Hair IMMEDIATELY started shedding and got huge sores on scalp.","x":"Hair IMMEDIATELY started shedding and got huge sores on scalp.","h":5,"v":1,"d":"Nov 2021"},{"id":"B0B86TKMP8-5","r":1.0,"t":"Don\u2019t use the bamboo holder unless you want a moldy mess","x":"I ordered 2 containers, one for shampoo and one for the conditioner. I\u2019ve been using them for about a month, shampooing my hair every 2 days. By the end of the month the containers were basically all black from molds. This picture is what it looks like even after I cleaned the containers. Save yourself a trouble and just use plastic/metal bar soap holders.","h":4,"v":0,"d":"Jun 2022"},{"id":"B0B86TKMP8-6","r":3.0,"t":"It\u2019s ok","x":"Top cover of holder had mold growing on the handle within weeks, this was kept on a shelf in the shower that did not have direct water on it. Ended up throwing out cover n keeping bottom.","h":3,"v":1,"d":"Jul 2022"},{"id":"B0B86TKMP8-7","r":2.0,"t":"Bamboo is very susceptible to mold","x":"If you have a mold problem in your shower, don't buy this. I learned the hard way that bamboo is VERY susceptible to mold growth. Only had the bamboo holder for 2 weeks before I had to throw it out.","h":2,"v":0,"d":"Jan 2022"},{"id":"B0B86TKMP8-8","r":1.0,"t":"Molded Immediately","x":"Within a week the holder was completely molded. I also didn\u2019t receive any warning or care instructions about this problem.","h":2,"v":0,"d":"Nov 2021"},{"id":"B0B86TKMP8-9","r":1.0,"t":"BEWARE, DECEIVING PICTURES!!!","x":"BUYER BEWARE!!! Pictures were deceiving! I thought I was getting the soap along with the holder and much to my surprise all I got was an extremely expensive holder. Seriously, how deceiving to talk all about their soap and different smells and made me think that I was getting a soap with it. Arrgghh well I learned my lesson and will make sure to read the product description better. Too much of a bother to return, since they took away Kohl's to return items. Totally disappointed and dissatisfied!","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Feb 2023"},{"id":"B0B86TKMP8-10","r":5.0,"t":"I am pleased with this product","x":"After using the product several weeks my hair has become soft and less tangled also my natural curls are coming back and my hair seems to be lighter and not get oily as quick. I can go 5 days without washing if I am not using other products like spray etc. I am not using a conditioner.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Jul 2022"},{"id":"B0B86TKMP8-11","r":1.0,"t":"Disappointed","x":"The shampoo and conditioner bars are awesome but this bamboo holder grew mold after ten days of use. It did not stay in the shower the entire time but regardless ended up with mold spots on the lid and the sides. Will find a different storage container for my shampoo.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Oct 2022"},{"id":"B0B86TKMP8-12","r":3.0,"t":"It fits the bars nicely but the lid is a different color. The top of the lid is green colored.","x":"I love that it fits the bars and looks nice, except the top of the lid does not match the rest of the holder as the top of the lid is green colored. I don\u2019t like the green color on the top of the lid . It would look better if it all was the same bamboo color.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Jan 2022"},{"id":"B0B86TKMP8-13","r":5.0,"t":"Beautiful an spacious","x":"[[VIDEOID:a0f842ac7f0f196440f2645c410e85ff]] I love this I can put my viori shampoo bar an conditioner bar in them. I even cured them in oven to last longer.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Sep 2022"},{"id":"B0B86TKMP8-14","r":1.0,"t":"MOLD in less than 1 month!","x":"Very cute, but overpriced for something that doesn't stack (cannot stack 2 or more to save space) & quickly molds.  Believe the pictures you see on Amazon.","h":1,"v":0,"d":"Jan 2023"},{"id":"B0B86TKMP8-15","r":1.0,"t":"Absolute Trash","x":"These sat in my shower for 2 weeks before they started to mold. Nasty. I thought bamboo was \u201cnaturally anti microbial\u201d??? Absolute waste of money.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Nov 2022"},{"id":"B0B86TKMP8-16","r":5.0,"t":"Protects shampoo bar","x":"Unlike other soap dishes, this cute thing protects the contents from being splashed by water. Super smart and looks so Zen in my shower cut out","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Jun 2023"},{"id":"B0B86TKMP8-17","r":5.0,"t":"So cute, protect your beauty investment","x":"This wicker basket is so cute and very expertly made. Love it. Too bad the $17 shampoo bar I bought didn't come with one. Get it.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Nov 2022"},{"id":"B0B86TKMP8-18","r":5.0,"t":"Convenient","x":"Good size, nice quality and they don\u2019t take up much room in the shower. Recommend these for shampoo/conditioner bars!","h":1,"v":1,"d":"May 2023"},{"id":"B0B86TKMP8-19","r":1.0,"t":"Mold","x":"Love the Bar\u2019s Of shampoo and conditioner. But the bamboo holders are awful. They mold very quickly. Waste of money","h":1,"v":0,"d":"Aug 2022"},{"id":"B0B86TKMP8-20","r":3.0,"t":"Mildew in container","x":"I like the soap/conditioner, but found mildew in both shampoo and conditioner bamboo drainage boxes.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"May 2022"},{"id":"B0B86TKMP8-21","r":1.0,"t":"A la semana se lleno de moho","x":"En una semana de estar depositando mi jab\u00f3n en el recipiente se empez\u00f3 a llenar de mohos","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Dec 2022"},{"id":"B0B86TKMP8-22","r":1.0,"t":"Molded","x":"Disappointed that despite it not getting directly wet that it quickly molded.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Apr 2023"},{"id":"B0B86TKMP8-23","r":5.0,"t":"Nice but both don\u2019t fit in the box","x":"The shampoo and conditioner both do not not fit in the holder","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Jan 2023"},{"id":"B0B86TKMP8-24","r":1.0,"t":"not worth it","x":"go to dollar store and buy $1.00  soap hold. this is rip off","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Feb 2022"}],"emb":"","summary":{"claims":[{"text":"Many reviewers report the bamboo holder grows mold quickly, often within weeks or even days, even when kept out of direct water.","cites":[1,6,7,8,9,12,15]},{"text":"Several reviewers say curing the holder with cooking oil and baking it prevents mold, and recommend doing this before use.","cites":[3,4,14]},{"text":"Some reviewers note the holder only holds one bar and cannot stack, so it doesn't store both shampoo and conditioner bars.","cites":[2,15]},{"text":"A few reviewers complain the product is overpriced or that pictures were deceiving about what is included.","cites":[10,15]},{"text":"Some reviewers praise the holder for fitting the bars nicely and keeping them dry and drained.","cites":[4,13,14]}]},"qa":[]}